# Cloudflare Pages — redirects

# ── Canonical 301 redirects ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

# /home → / (duplicate landing)
/home    /    301

# /privacy-policy → /privacy (legacy URL)
/privacy-policy    /privacy    301

# ── SPA fallback routing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All routes fall through to index.html so React Router handles them client-side
/*    /index.html   200
